Gears of War 3: selective texture dumps. `texture_dump_hashes` (comma-separated 16-hex-digit guest
texture hashes) dumps just those textures to the pack dump folder the first time each loads, also
with `texture_dump` off. The button prompt replacement uses it to capture the player's own two prompt
atlases on first run, so the replacement atlases are built from the player's copy of the game.

